, "versionNonce": 72790, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "READ PATH (data in)\nFabric governed assets -> Isnad YAML mapping (or MCP pull)\n-> Postgres (bitemporal, RLS) -> semantic graph.\nFabric stays the data and memory foundation;\nIsnad holds the operational model on top.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "READ PATH (data in)\nFabric governed assets -> Isnad YAML mapping (or MCP pull)\n-> Postgres (bitemporal, RLS) -> semantic graph.\nFabric stays the data and memory foundation;\nIsnad holds the operational model on top.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e82", "type": "rectangle", "x": 690, "y": 1500, "width": 600, "height": 130, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 668997, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 494873, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e83", "type": "text", "x": 698, "y": 1527.5, "width": 584, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 284950, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 683432, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "WRITE PATH (decisions out)\napproved action -> one transaction -> audit -> outbox\n-> webhook / API to the system of record or Fabric.\nAgents never write straight into Fabric.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "WRITE PATH (decisions out)\napproved action -> one transaction -> audit -> outbox\n-> webhook / API to the system of record or Fabric.\nAgents never write straight into Fabric.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e84", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 1660, "width": 400, "height": 140, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 305874, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 773386, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e85", "type": "text", "x": 68, "y": 1692.5, "width": 384, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 820153, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 627707, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "ADDED VALUE FOR HUMAIN ONE\nHUMAIN ONE automates HR, finance,\nprocurement. Isnad adds shared meaning,\nmulti-hop impact, history and audit.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "ADDED VALUE FOR HUMAIN ONE\nHUMAIN ONE automates HR, finance,\nprocurement. Isnad adds shared meaning,\nmulti-hop impact, history and audit.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e86", "type": "rectangle", "x": 490, "y": 1660, "width": 400, "height": 140, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 251976, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 466250, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e87", "type": "text", "x": 498, "y": 1692.5, "width": 384, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 524768, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 709528, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "TWO-WAY MCP (to build)\nIsnad consumes Fabric's MCP data;\nIsnad tools (query, traverse, propose)\ncan be exposed as MCP to other agents.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "TWO-WAY MCP (to build)\nIsnad consumes Fabric's MCP data;\nIsnad tools (query, traverse, propose)\ncan be exposed as MCP to other agents.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e88", "type": "rectangle", "x": 920, "y": 1660, "width": 370, "height": 140, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 261148, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 997550, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e89", "type": "text", "x": 928, "y": 1692.5, "width": 354, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 222484, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 818972, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "IDENTITY + GOVERNANCE\nFabric/enterprise SSO groups map to\nIsnad roles; Fabric governance feeds\nmasking; Isnad adds per-edge filtering.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "IDENTITY + GOVERNANCE\nFabric/enterprise SSO groups map to\nIsnad roles; Fabric governance feeds\nmasking; Isnad adds per-edge filtering.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e90", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 1830, "width": 1230, "height": 170, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 50322, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 111301, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e91", "type": "text", "x": 68, "y": 1877.5, "width": 1214, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 54345, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 984706, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "HONEST STATUS\nIsnad today runs on simulated data in Postgres. NOT built: Fabric connector, MCP client or server, SSO, live Claude run.\nUnverified: Fabric's actual APIs, MCP tool surface, governance model and how HUMAIN ONE would call external tools (only press pages seen).\nNext step would be a documented integration spec once Fabric docs or access are available.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "HONEST STATUS\nIsnad today runs on simulated data in Postgres. NOT built: Fabric connector, MCP client or server, SSO, live Claude run.\nUnverified: Fabric's actual APIs, MCP tool surface, governance model and how HUMAIN ONE would call external tools (only press pages seen).\nNext step would be a documented integration spec once Fabric docs or access are available.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "baseline": 15}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}